<<<
May a woman not be said to cry till she howls? are there no clerks but those in Holy Orders? is a milliner’s box no longer to be a band-box? And, to come back to dies, is it a blunder to call London to Moscow a journey, or a pedantry to call it anything else
===
May a woman not be said to *cry* till she howls? are there no *clerks* but those in Holy Orders? is a milliner's box no longer to be a *band-box*? And, to come back to *dies*, is it a blunder to call London to Moscow a *journey*, or a pedantry to call it anything else
>>>

